  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex Dynawire is a nylon monofilament synthetic gut reinforced with a heat-resistant metal film for crisp feel, easy power and high durability. Designed for players of all swing speeds, it offers a firmer and more responsive response than Yonex's REXIS multifilaments while sacrificing some comfort and ball pocketing. On Yonex's official Comfort & Playability map, Dynawire sits at the firmest and most responsive end of the non-polyester lineup, making it especially suitable for players who want a direct, durable and powerful nylon stringbed.",

    "zh": "Yonex Dynawire 是一款采用 Nylon Monofilament 实心尼龙结构并加入 Heat-Resistant Metal Film 耐热金属膜的 Synthetic Gut。它的核心特点是 Crisp Feel、Power 和 High Durability。相比 Yonex REXIS 多芯系列，Dynawire 明显更硬、更直接、更耐打，同时 Ball Pocketing 和舒适性较低。根据 Yonex 官方 Comfort & Playability 图，Dynawire 位于整个非聚酯系列中最靠近 Firm 与 Responsive 的区域，因此特别适合喜欢清晰击球反馈、容易获得力量、同时希望球线寿命更长的俱乐部球员。"
  },

